WEBVTT

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:05.730
Senpai's too good for this association!

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:06.860
Senpai?

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:13.240
Yeah! I can't understand why Senpai 
even joined an association like this!

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.570
Senpai?

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.530
But we're all first-years...

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.490
I'm talking about Arima Hizume-senpai!

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:21.070
Huh?

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.520
You're talking about Hizume?

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.960
Wait, but we're the same age.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.360
Maybe she was held back a year?

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.560
Or she didn't get in the first time...

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.010
Stop thinking such rude things about Senpai!

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.880
I saw your performance at the park.
You made <i>so</i> many mistakes!

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.910
<i>Oh, so she was in the audience.</i>

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:38.960
The timing on your stunts was 
off, and you were shaky.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:42.680
When you changed formation, 
you couldn't keep smiling.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.890
The heights of your front kicks were uneven,

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:48.650
and your pivoting foot being crooked 
during the side kick is just unacceptable!

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:49.690
Um...

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.020
Not to mention—

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.480
Thanks for observing us so carefully.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.900
Why are you thanking me?! 
I'm pointing out your failures!

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.530
Anyway, just so you know,
I won't accept the existence of

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:00.390
such a half-assed cheer association!

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.210
Ow...

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:06.410
I'm very sorry.

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:09.480
Are you all right?

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.860
Hizume!

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.860
Hizume-chan!

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:14.300
S-S-S...

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.980
<b>Anima Yell!</b>

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:48.020
<b>A/V Room</b>

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:48.020
Um...

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:49.390
If you'll excuse me!

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:53.610
Why is she here?

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:55.660
Is she a friend of yours?

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:59.290
Yes. She's one of the girls from my old squad.

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:01.740
I had no idea we went to 
the same high school.

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:04.090
Absolutely no idea.

00:03:04.090 --> 00:03:07.150
C-Can you really call her your friend, then?

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:08.910
I sorta feel bad for her.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.500
Are you her senpai?

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:16.250
She... Ushiku-san joined the squad 
after me, so she called me that.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.380
So her name is Ushiku-san.

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:22.990
In that case, you're all my senpai.

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:24.140
Peep!

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.940
<i>I'm finally Cheer-senpai!</i>

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:31.140
<i>Cheer-senpai... Cheer-senpai... 
Cheer-senpai...</i>

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:31.140
Just because you started before another 
member doesn't give you seniority.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.980
We're all teammates.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:36.220
Y-You're right! Teammates, yeah!

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:37.980
You seem a little disappointed.

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:42.990
But I wonder what Ushiku-san wanted.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:46.370
She seemed to be concerned 
about you, Hizume-chan.

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:49.840
Perhaps she came to greet 
me when she found out

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:52.440
a former teammate was 
going to the same school.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:54.400
Maybe she wanted to join!

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:57.850
Uh... It sure didn't seem that way to me.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:59.300
Um...

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:00.970
Got a sec?

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:03.130
Hey, it's an actual senpai!

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:05.760
Actual?

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:09.810
<b>Episode 8: Senpai and Me</b>

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.860
You're going to the prefectural tournament?

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.240
That's amazing!

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:12.480
That must mean you won 
the regional tournament.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.030
Congratulations!

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:18.070
Thanks. So I wanted to ask you 
guys to cheer for us again.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:20.420
Actually...

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.960
Captain! Let's ask them 
to cheer for us again!

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:24.330
We need cheerleaders!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.720
We need cheers!

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.690
The rest of the team was 
thirsting for cheers.

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:29.700
Looks like they're hooked.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.510
This time, we're not just 
asking you to cheer for us.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:36.120
We'd also like you to perform 
before the game and at halftime,

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:39.080
so it'd be like cheering for 
all the schools participating.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:43.590
Let's do it! The more people we have to 
cheer on, the more worthwhile it'll be!

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:48.150
Yeah, I figured you'd feel that way.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:51.180
<b>Concerning Basketball Team Prefectural
Tournament Choreography</b>

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.180
Here's an idea.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:55.590
Why don't we try to choreograph
 the routine together?

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.700
I-I-I couldn't!

00:04:58.700 --> 00:04:59.900
Choreography!

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:01.200
No way...

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.110
We'll be fine.

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:07.130
No matter what the routine may be, 
it won't be scary if we all do it together!

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:10.200
Hizume, that's not reassuring at all!

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:13.690
I was kidding. If you could 
come up with some moves,

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:17.330
<b>Concerning Basketball Team Prefectural
Tournament Choreography</b>

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:17.330
we'll put together the best parts, 
and I'll make the final choreography.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:19.920
<i>She looked totally serious about it.</i>

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.340
Question!

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:24.600
Is there some kind of trick 
to coming up with moves?

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:26.030
Trick...

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:30.720
In my case, I'll listen to a song 
and let my imagination go to work.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:34.380
Do you have any songs 
you'd like to dance to?

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.910
Off the top of my head?

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:38.510
I hadn't thought about that.

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:40.230
Oh, oh! In that case...

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:42.570
How about this?

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:45.070
Hey, I've heard this song before!

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.880
I think that'd be perfect.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:49.260
This sounds like it'd be easy to choreograph.

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:50.320
No complaints here.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:53.160
Yay! Thanks, guys!

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:59.720
This is also just me, but I visualize 
someone dancing in my head

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:02.180
and try to objectively come 
up with dance moves.

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:09.550
Visualize someone dancing in 
my head and objectively...

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:11.690
I got it!

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:13.180
Huh? That was fast!

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:17.880
Um, um... Visualize someone 
dancing in my head...

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:24.810
I can't do this! It's too hard!

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:26.570
<i>She visualized herself failing!</i>

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:34.080
Why don't we take this assignment home?

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:36.500
Try thinking about it overnight.

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:42.280
Everyone's going to be dancing it, 
so I have to make sure it's decent!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.920
Since I'm using my head, I need 
to refuel with some sugar!

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:04.470
The sweet taste is still in my mouth. 
I'll go make some black tea.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:05.900
And She's Derailed

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.280
Hmm...

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:11.370
Gather materials...

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:13.240
What else am I supposed to do?

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:18.340
<i>Please welcome today's guests, the idol 
group produced by YUTA-san, STAR!</i>

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:20.910
<i>Produce...</i>

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:24.920
<i>Yeah... This isn't it.</i>

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:28.280
<i>There should be moves that'll make 
Kohane shine even more!</i>

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:32.090
Cuter! And more energetic!

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:34.680
She's completely forgotten the fact 
that she'll also be dancing this

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.880
Choreography, huh?

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:39.180
I wonder what kind of cheer 
I should come up with.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:42.940
I'll include that, and...
I want to do this, too.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:46.120
Oh! And I definitely want to put that in!

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:51.640
Okay! I'm done!

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:54.320
Completely filled

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:57.290
Hizume said she'd figure it out.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.830
Leaving all the 
work to Hizume

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:09.710
<i>Perhaps these photos and DVDs of my 
old squad will give me some ideas.</i>

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:13.720
<i>Ushiku-san isn't in any of these photos.</i>

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.720
<i>I'm sure she was in the squad, though...</i>

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.640
She's there

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.850
<b>Concerning Basketball Team Prefectural
Tournament Choreography</b>

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:19.850
How did it go, everyone?

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:21.400
I finished!

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:23.160
I guess it'll work...

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:24.350
Me, too.

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:27.860
All right, I'll brush up your ideas,

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.340
so please practice on your own today.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.620
Did you notice, Kotetsu?

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:35.460
Yeah.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.910
She's here again.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:42.540
Hey... If you're curious, 
why don't you just come in?

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.080
Uki, who are you talking to?

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.040
Uh...

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:50.670
Oh, is it Ghostie-chan? Does 
Ghostie-chan actually exist?!

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:53.300
<i>She hasn't recognized her presence at all!</i>

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.800
The next day

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.680
Okay, that'll be our choreography.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.310
All that's left is to practice.

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:07.310
We need to do our best for 
the basketball team, too!

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.570
R-Right...

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:12.570
And the next day

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:12.570
Kohane-san, keep your wrists 
straight and horizontal.

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.570
L-Like this?

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:20.040
One more time! One, two, three, 
four, five, six, seven, eight!

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:18.060
I wonder if Ushiku-san has 
nothing better to do...

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:21.950
Uh, I can't argue with that...

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.950
Two, two, three, four...

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:24.710
A few days later

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:24.710
Tomorrow's finally the day.

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:27.460
Let's do our best so that we don't get hurt.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:29.720
I'm so nervous...

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:32.210
We'll be fine! We practiced lots!

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:34.460
Y-You're right...

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:36.180
We should be fine.

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:36.970
<b>Come forth to the roof</b>

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:39.720
<b>Curse</b>

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:39.530
<i>It's that scary handwriting again.</i>

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:44.850
So you came.

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:47.190
Ushiku-san?

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:50.670
There's something I want to ask you.

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:54.280
Why is Senpai cheering with you guys?

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.640
You guys can't even do 
low-level techniques.

00:09:56.640 --> 00:10:00.080
Her previous squad was much better.

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:04.120
Um... Maybe you should ask Hizume yourself.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:05.900
Why are you asking me?

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:11.040
I mean... How am I supposed 
to speak directly to her?!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.250
I'm not worthy!

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:15.930
I think it's because she doesn't care about

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:17.760
our skill levels and is just having fun.

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:21.480
She's softened up quite a bit.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:22.740
That's...

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:24.770
That's...

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:33.160
I don't know much about her old squad,

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:34.010
but we—

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:34.520
Enough!

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:37.240
Stop acting like you know her!

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:39.720
You don't know anything!

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.050
Ow...

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:56.300
H-Hey! Are you okay?

00:10:57.010 --> 00:11:00.140
Y-Yeah, I think so...

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:02.280
I'm used to this kind of 
thing because of Kohane.

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:03.640
Slide!

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:04.550
Used to it?

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:08.970
More importantly, why don't you try 
to talk to Hizume face to face?

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:09.640
Huh?

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:13.560
If you're so concerned, you should 
ask her how she really feels.

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:18.120
Everything I said is just 
based on assumptions.

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:19.900
You're right...

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:24.730
I guess we all visualize 
things differently.

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:29.500
<i>Yeah, I'm pretty sure the way we 
visualize Hizume is way different.</i>

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:33.070
Now that that's settled, let's hurry 
up before you change your mind.

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:33.630
Ow!

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:36.280
Ouch...

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:39.920
Apparently it's a light sprain.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.050
Uki-chan?!

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:43.310
Are you okay, Uki?

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:46.340
I'm fine. If I just tape my ankle—

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:51.630
<i>I told her to talk to her face to face,</i>

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:53.310
<i>but she hasn't been able to.</i>

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:55.150
I-I'm so sorry!

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:57.400
This is all my fault! I—

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:58.900
Ushiku-san.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.470
Don't tell me...

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:06.750
Take that!

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:09.530
Ushiku-san used some kind 
of move on Uki-san's leg?

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:11.290
What kind of scary situation would that be?!

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:14.170
No, I just fell.

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.630
I slipped on the roof.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:19.170
No! She protected me when 
I was about to fall.

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:22.470
It doesn't even hurt that much. I'm fine.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:25.680
I believe I understand what's going on,

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:29.430
but even if it's just a light sprain, 
we can't take this lightly.

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:32.120
We'll perform tomorrow
with just the three of us.

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:37.310
Maybe we can just adjust the 
timing between the four of us...

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:41.200
There's a part where we do 
alternating roll-offs, too.

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:44.490
Um... it'd be a little hard without Uki...

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:46.940
Um...

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:52.790
<b>Kaminoki Municipal Gymnasium</b>

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:58.040
Basketball-senpai!

00:12:59.280 --> 00:12:59.960
Hey.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.590
Thanks for having us today!

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.580
Yeah, thanks for coming!

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:06.020
Wait, uh...

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:09.230
Did you change your look, Sawatari-san?

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:12.220
That'd be a plastic surgery kind of change!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:17.830
Thank goodness Uki's uniform 
fits you perfectly.

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:21.860
I wouldn't say it's perfect. 
The area around the chest is...

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:25.230
Then we should make a uniform for you, too!

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:26.280
Why?

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.920
I'm only doing this because I'm 
responsible for what happened.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:32.290
I can handle it being a bit snug.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:34.880
Aw, come on, Ushiku-san!

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:36.490
Kohane, go get ready.

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:37.500
Okay!

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:41.500
Kohane, you're drinking too much water.

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:44.590
I'll put the towels out here.

00:13:44.930 --> 00:13:47.220
I'll do everything I can 
to support you guys today.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:51.310
Uki, you're sort of like...

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:54.100
I was just thinking the same thing.

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:56.360
I feel like...

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:58.070
I'm a wife.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.680
A manager!

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:03.340
Yes! A manager! Exactly!

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:04.570
Did you just say—

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.240
A manager!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.920
Wait, you totally said something different.

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:10.780
I said "manager"!

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:11.640
You're lying!

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:12.590
Ushiku-san.

00:14:12.590 --> 00:14:13.990
Y-Yes?

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:18.300
We were only able to practice together 
yesterday. Will you be all right?

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:19.500
I-I'll be fine!

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:24.250
It's been a while since I've done cheer, 
but the routines were all pretty easy.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:28.570
It's been a while? Did you quit 
the squad, Ushiku-san?

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:30.360
Y-Yes...

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:34.040
I kept practicing on my own, 
but... with the squad...

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.030
High school just got too busy.

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:40.570
<i>There was no point in staying on 
the squad without you there...</i>

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:43.270
<i>I feel a very overbearing presence...</i>

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:01.790
Wow... There are so many people!

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:04.880
Let's do our best today.

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:06.440
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:08.860
Hey, let's all form a circle!

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:09.910
Let's group up!

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:13.050
I have a request...

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:16.960
S-So this is what an Instagram 
shot looks like...

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:18.430
Big bro strikes again, huh?

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:22.040
<i>Before we begin the match,</i>

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:26.150
<i>the Kaminoki cheer association will perform.</i>

00:15:26.630 --> 00:15:29.540
<i>Everyone, please give them 
a round of applause.</i>

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.180
<i>She's amazing!</i>

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:41.800
<i>Ushiku-san's movements 
are big and really sharp,</i>

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:43.180
<i>so she really stands out!</i>

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:44.780
<i>And...</i>

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.820
<i>Her performance is so energetic!</i>

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:59.030
Kaminoki Basketball

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:11.840
Let's go, Kaminoki! Go for win!

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:15.340
Let's go, Kaminoki! Go for win!

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:18.850
Let's go, Kaminoki! Go for win!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:22.380
Let's go, Kaminoki! Go for win!

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:25.680
Let's go, Kaminoki! Go for win!

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:29.260
Let's go, Kaminoki! Go for win!

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:29.600
<i>No, no... I'm filling in for Sawatari-san!</i>

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:32.470
Let's go, Kaminoki! Go for win!

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:31.820
<i>I need to concentrate and do this right!</i>

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:37.570
It went in!

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:39.930
Do this right!

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:40.700
Huh?

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:43.200
Hoshigaoka Girls

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:43.200
Kaminoki

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:43.200
It's halftime!

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:45.340
Make sure you all get re-hydrated.

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:47.380
You're back on after a quick breather.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.800
Great job, Ushiku-san! You had 
the choreography down perfectly.

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.160
Yeah!

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:59.290
You have... a lot of energy, too...

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:03.140
I think you could conserve more 
energy if you'd shut up once a while.

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:05.990
Right, Hizume?

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:07.390
Yes.

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:10.820
Your moves are very clean, and 
your performance is wonderful.

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:17.530
Hey, she's relaxing a bit.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.900
Senpai complimented me.

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:24.990
So this is what your cheer 
looks like, Ushiku-san.

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:27.710
This is going to sound rude,

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:32.500
but I don't remember much about you 
or the other squad members.

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:37.290
I was so obsessed with cheerleading 
that I didn't even notice

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:39.610
the people around me.

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:44.200
Everyone else... was basically 
potatoes in a field.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:46.090
Go for win!

00:18:46.090 --> 00:18:48.100
That's terrifying in itself.

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.510
I know this might be a little late,

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:56.990
but I'm really happy that I got to 
cheer with you today, Ushiku-san.

00:18:58.820 --> 00:18:59.990
<i>Senpai...</i>

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:03.820
<i>I'm the one who's happy to cheer with you.</i>

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:07.500
<i>But... all I ever did was watch you.</i>

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.040
<i>That's why I can tell...</i>

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:13.980
<i>She's actually having 
fun now, unlike before.</i>

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:16.000
<i>Also...</i>

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:19.020
<i>Her skin is softer, and her hair smells nicer.</i>

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:21.050
Her upper arms even look different.

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.010
<i>Yikes! This is getting dangerous...</i>

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:28.020
<i>But just like Senpai only paid 
attention to cheerleading,</i>

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:31.610
<i>I was also only looking at Senpai.</i>

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:35.020
<i>I mean, has cheerleading always been</i>

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:38.170
<i>something you do together like this?</i>

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:44.410
<i>Senpai used to always look stoic and even 
a little pained when she was cheerleading,</i>

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:47.660
<i>but now she looks like 
she's having so much fun.</i>

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.140
<i>That's all that matters.</i>

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.450
<i>If that's what makes Senpai happy...</i>

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:59.830
<i>No... No...</i>

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:05.550
No!

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:10.680
Arrows (<i>ya</i>)?

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:19.690
<i>I want to cheer with Senpai, too!</i>

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:22.200
<i>I want to laugh with her!</i>

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:26.950
<i>Even if I wasn't able to change Senpai,</i>

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:32.520
<i>I'd been watching her this whole time!</i>

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:36.210
<i>Wh-Whoa...</i>

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:41.050
<i>Ushiku-san's cheerleading 
is so full of emotion.</i>

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.850
<i>Cheerleading is so...</i>

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:46.420
Hmph.

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:49.220
Is that what it's like?

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:51.180
Hoshigaoka Girls

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:51.180
Kaminoki

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:56.040
They did it!

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:57.520
They won!

00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:04.140
Basketball-senpai, congratulations!

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:05.660
Thanks!

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:13.400
Senpai!

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:16.220
Please...

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:18.170
continue to

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:20.170
watch my cheerleading!

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:25.170
But...

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:28.080
We're already done cheering for the day.

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:30.330
U-Um, that's not what I meant...

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:31.560
Support!

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:34.680
So you're going to join us!

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:36.110
That makes me very happy.

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:37.800
Really, Ushiku-san?

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:41.440
Then why don't you stop calling me "Senpai"?

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:44.100
We're teammates, after all.

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:46.730
Please just call me "Hizume."

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:48.920
I'm Kohane!

00:21:48.920 --> 00:21:51.100
Um... I'm Kotetsu...

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:51.950
Call me Uki.

00:21:55.960 --> 00:22:06.420
<b>Kaminoki Municipal Gymnasium</b>

00:21:57.320 --> 00:21:59.680
Ushiku-san fainted!

00:21:59.680 --> 00:22:01.260
A-Are you all right?

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:01.920
Ushiku-san!

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:02.720
Ushiku-san!

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:04.550
Hey, wake up!

00:23:38.340 --> 00:23:42.020
Next time: "The Captain Is Chosen! 
Five-Person Cheer Squad."
